## Typography Scale

Import from `@/constants/design-tokens`: `PAGE_TITLE_CLASS`, `CARD_TITLE_CLASS`, `TEXT_SMALL`, `TEXT_KPI`, etc.

| Role | Tailwind (via constants) |
|------|---------------------------|
| Card title | `CARD_TITLE_CLASS` (22px, bold) |
| Brand / Section | `text-base font-bold` |
| Body / Label | `text-sm font-medium` |
| Small / CTA | `TEXT_SMALL_SEMIBOLD` |
| Caption | `text-xs` |
| KPI value | `TEXT_KPI` (32px) |

**Font:** Inter via `next/font/google`. Use `font-sans` or `var(--font-sans)`.

---

## Spacing Scale

| Value | Context | Tailwind |
|-------|---------|----------|
| 4px | Tight gaps | `gap-1` |
| 6px | Form label + input | `gap-1.5` |
| 8px | Nav items, buttons | `gap-2`, `p-2` |
| 12px | Button groups | `gap-3` |
| 16px | Sidebar items | `gap-4`, `p-4` |
| 20px | Card content | `gap-5` |
| 24px | Section spacing | `gap-6`, `p-6` |
| 28px | Card padding | `p-7` |

**Forbidden:** `p-[Xpx]`, `gap-[Xpx]`, `m-[Xpx]`. Use the scale above.

---

## Border Radius

| Size | Context | Tailwind |
|------|---------|----------|
| xs | Section titles | `rounded-[2px]` |
| sm | Nav items, buttons | `rounded-md` |
| md | Buttons, inputs | `rounded-lg` |
| lg | Cards | `rounded-xl` |

Use `RADIUS_SM`, `RADIUS_MD`, `RADIUS_LG`, `CARD_RADIUS` from `@/constants/design-tokens`.

---

## No Shadows

Cards and surfaces: `rounded-xl border border-border bg-card`. No shadows.

---

## Layout Dimensions

| Element | Width | Tailwind |
|---------|-------|----------|
| Sidebar | 256px | `W_SIDEBAR` / `w-sidebar` |
| Form / Card | 300–400px | `W_FORM`, `W_COLUMN` |
| Content | 1100px | `MAX_W_CONTENT` |

Use `flex-1` for fill; `w-full` for full-width.

---

## Tailwind v4

- `@import "tailwindcss"` in globals.css (no `@tailwind` directives)
- Use `@theme inline` for mapping CSS vars to Tailwind
- Fonts: utility classes in `@layer base`
